=================================
LASP-ac3.7.3 "2024.12.19"
=================================

www.lasphub.com

CONTENTS:
=========
Src         : Executable file for all editions. Source files and static libraries for INTERFACE(expert) edition.
Libraries   : Functions and external packages that LASP might need.

COMPILE:
========
For NN\NC\FULL version:
The main executable file (./Src/lasp) has been compiled using Intel Compiler.

For NSLV version:
the libvasp.so library file needs to be compiled by user.
To do so, please check ./Libraries/1.vasplib/README
Make sure the "libvasp.so" file is placed in your $LD_LIBRARY_PATH evironment variables.

For Interface version:
setup the intel compiler, go to ./Src, then make.
To use other function module, such as vasp, lammps etc, please follow the ./Libraries/README

Run:
====
mpirun -np $nslots lasp

if "potential external" is used, then lasp should be run in serial.


